sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Analyst
    participant Client as AI Agent / MCP Client
    participant Server as ISO 20022 MCP Server
    participant Parser as XML Parser & Validator
    participant Engine as Evidence Correlation
    participant Codes as Code Lookup
    Analyst->>Client: Analyze supplied pacs.008 and pacs.002
    Client->>Server: initialize / initialized
    Client->>Server: tools/list
    Server-->>Client: Tool definitions and schemas
    Client->>Server: tools/call validate_message(pacs.008)
    Server->>Parser: Validate business + schema/security state
    Parser-->>Server: business_valid=true, schema=not_configured
    Server-->>Client: Structured validation result
    Client->>Server: tools/call investigate_payment(pacs.008,pacs.002)
    Server->>Engine: Correlate OrgnlMsgId + EndToEndId/UETR
    Engine->>Codes: lookup_code(AC04)
    Codes-->>Engine: Closed account (bank-reported reason)
    Engine-->>Server: Matched status RJCT + evidence paths
    Server-->>Client: Evidence, limitations, no automatic retry
    Client-->>Analyst: Cited rejection explanation + human review
